## Before you start

- **Role mapping:** nothing in the code I've seen shows how a login becomes 1st line, 2nd line or MBO/MDO. Session 0 will tell you whether SAML group claims exist; if not, that's a question for Satish before slice 1.
- **Order:** slice 1 must merge first. Slices 2 to 4 can then run in parallel, and slice 5 goes last because the dashboard tile depends on it.
- **Open questions:** the 1st/2nd line split, correction go-live timing and run frequency are all written so the build doesn't block on them, but each will need a follow-up change once decided.
